    {
      "id": "mongo-content",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 25,
      "y": 115,
      "width": 155,
      "height": 540,
      "text": "────────────────\n\n📦 Collections\n  • users\n  • challenges\n  • bets\n  • photos\n  • comments\n  • follows\n  • metrics\n\n────────────────\n\n📁 GridFS\n  Photo/video blobs\n  (base64 or streamed)\n\n────────────────\n\n⚡ Change Streams\n  Watch bets + photos\n  inserts → trigger\n  realtime Socket.io\n  push to all clients\n\n  • emitTicker (global)\n  • emitHype (per-room)\n\n────────────────\n\n🔑 Key Patterns\n  • Idempotent by txSig\n  • Mirrors on-chain\n    bets to Mongo\n  • Time-series metrics\n  • Replica set required",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#087f5b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 7,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 7,
