    },
    {
      "id": "solana-content",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 880,
      "y": 115,
      "width": 155,
      "height": 540,
      "text": "────────────────\n\n🦀 Anchor Program\n  Parimutuel markets\n  Checked math\n  PDA signer seeds\n\n────────────────\n\n📝 Instructions\n  • initialize_market\n    (creator signs)\n  • place_bet\n    (bettor signs)\n  • resolve_market\n    (authority signs)\n  • claim_winnings\n    (winner signs)\n  • refund_market\n    (authority signs)\n\n────────────────\n\n🔐 PDA Seeds\n  market =\n    [\"market\", creator, slug]\n  vault =\n    [\"vault\", market]\n  position =\n    [\"position\", market, bettor]\n\n────────────────\n\n💰 Parimutuel Math\n  Live odds = pool share\n  Payout = stake +\n    proportional share\n    of losing pool\n  Vault PDA holds escrow",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#7e22ce",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 10,
